CORE
SarifResultTest
-cp target/classes --sarif-result -
activate-multi-line-match
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
"name": "jbmc"
"informationUri": "https://www\.cprover\.org/jbmc/"
"ruleId": "java::SarifResultTest\.main:\(\[Ljava/lang/String;\)V\.assertion\.1"
"kind": "fail"
"level": "error"
--
^warning: ignoring
--
JBMC --sarif-result writes a SARIF log with the jbmc driver metadata
(name "jbmc", JBMC information URI) and an error-level result for the failing
Java assertion. Guards against the option being advertised but inert.
